{"uid":"c437fa6daddc5c5","name":"test_the_progress_budget_resets_the_moment_the_assigned_task_changes","fullName":"tests.test_progress_pin_task015#test_the_progress_budget_resets_the_moment_the_assigned_task_changes","historyId":"75cdb3fdf641e5b3ef76541f5565be6e","time":{"start":1791916125325,"stop":1791916125426,"duration":101},"description":"Task A is `in-progress`, task B is `pending`. Two corroborated\n    `file`-evidence passes spend task A's own budget up to 2/3; the third\n    pass reports `verdict: \"complete\"` for A (no progress block, plain\n    completion) -- the scheduler now assigns B; the fourth pass reports a\n    corroborated `file`-evidence claim on B. `_record_progress_budget_\n    usage` resets `used` to 1 the moment `assigned_id` no longer matches\n    the persisted record's own `taskId` -- proven here by reading\n    `status.json`'s `progressBudget` after the fourth pass and finding\n    `{\"taskId\": TASK_B, \"used\": 1, ...}`, not `{\"taskId\": TASK_B, \"used\":\n    3, ...}` (which is what a budget that failed to reset would show, by\n    carrying A's 2 used passes plus B's own one forward).","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task A is <code>in-progress</code>, task B is <code>pending</code>. Two corroborated<br />\n<code>file</code>-evidence passes spend task A's own budget up to 2/3; the third<br />\npass reports <code>verdict: &quot;complete&quot;</code> for A (no progress block, plain<br />\ncompletion) -- the scheduler now assigns B; the fourth pass reports a<br />\ncorroborated <code>file</code>-evidence claim on B. <code>_record_progress_budget_ usage</code> resets <code>used</code> to 1 the moment <code>assigned_id</code> no longer matches<br />\nthe persisted record's own <code>taskId</code> -- proven here by reading<br />\n<code>status.json</code>'s <code>progressBudget</code> after the fourth pass and finding<br />\n<code>{&quot;taskId&quot;: TASK_B, &quot;used&quot;: 1, ...}</code>, not <code>{&quot;taskId&quot;: TASK_B, &quot;used&quot;: 3, ...}</code> (which is what a budget that failed to reset would show, by<br />\ncarrying A's 2 used passes plus B's own one forward).</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791915518558,"stop":1791915518558,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791915518559,"stop":1791915518559,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791916125288,"stop":1791916125288,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791916125288,"stop":1791916125303,"duration":15},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791916125304,"stop":1791916125304,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791916125304,"stop":1791916125316,"duration":12},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escalation_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791916125316,"stop":179191612